      "quote": "Conclusion\nTree-of-Traversals is a powerful algorithm that en-\nables LLMs to utilize KG reasoning with zero\nexamples, no schema dependency, and no train-\ning. We demonstrate its efficacy experimentally\non multiple LLMs and datasets. We hope Tree-of-\nTraversals continues to be developed and see value\nin studying integration with personalized user KGs\nas well as with other domain-specific datasets.\n7\n",
