  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"节点值超过答案阈值时：搜索在找到节点值超过阈值 τ 的答案时停止（\\\"The search stops when an answer is found with a node value exceed-\\ning the threshold τ.\\\"）[chunk_dac5f23e1b87249cf88eff5c6cc54355]；算法中亦写明当答案超过阈值时置 finished 为 True 并返回答案集中值最大的答案 [chunk_a0d7d9ec00b3e121441cb8d4c6815b59]。达到 max depth 时：算法被强制转换到 done 状态，即回答查询（\\\"max depth of the tree search, after which the algorithm is forced to transition to the done state (i.e., answer the query)\\\"）[chunk_dac5f23e1b87249cf88eff5c6cc54355]。达到 max expansions 时：模型停止探索并返回 \\\"Cannot find answer\\\"（\\\"max expansions after which the model halts exploration and returns \\\\\\\"Cannot find answer\\\\\\\"\\\"）[chunk_dac5f23e1b87249cf88eff5c6cc54355]。\",\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_dac5f23e1b87249cf88eff5c6cc54355\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_a0d7d9ec00b3e121441cb8d4c6815b59\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"}],\"status\":\"ok\"}",
